      },
      "text": "By studying the network traffic of infected systems, CTU researchers determined that the server side of the Comfoo malware sends an HTTP server header identifying the server version as \"Apache 2.0.50 (Unix)\".",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
