        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s3"
      },
      "text": "Enables/disables the other ports Accepts new relay port configuration (stored in rlycfg.dll) Notifies master console that a new victim connection is available",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
