      },
      "text": "The following are DLL names commonly used by Comfoo: cmmos.dll jacpet.dll javadb.dll mszlobm.dll netfram.dll netman.dll ntdapie.dll ntdelu.dll ntobm.dll odbm.dll senss.dll suddec.dll tabcteng.dll vmmreg32.dll wininete.dll",
